      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div><p><em>奇物，極珍稀（+2）（需牧師或聖武士同調）</em> <br />這些卡牌背面刻有代表內層位面，外層位面，以及各個神明聖徽的符號。持握該牌組期間，你可以將其作爲施法法器，並且你在法術攻擊檢定及你的法術豁免DC上獲得加值。該加值由該牌組的珍稀度決定。<br />此外，持握該牌組期間，你可以用動作，抽一張牌，消耗並投擲一枚你的生命骰，加上該牌組的稀有度加值。離你30尺內你可見的一個生物受到等同於該結果的光耀傷害或回覆等同於該結果的生命值（由你選擇）。</p><p><em>(requires attunement by a cleric or paladin)</em></p></div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>The backs of these cards are inscribed with glyphs representing the Inner Planes, the Outer Planes, or the holy symbols of various deities. While holding this deck, you can use it as a spellcasting focus, and you gain a +2 bonus to spell attack rolls and to your spell save DC.</p><p>In addition, while you're holding the deck, you can draw a card as an action to expend and roll one of your Hit Dice and add the deck's bonus to the number rolled. One creature you can see within 30 feet of you either takes radiant damage or regains hit points (your choice) equal to the total.</p></div>",
